  <content>
  <section><title>Activity</title>
<para>The table and graph show a more complete picture of the temperature changes on the same winter day. The function \(T\) gives the temperature, in degrees Fahrenheit, \(h\) hours since noon.</para>
<para><figure><media alt="Discrete function. hours since noon and temperature in degrees Fahrenheit."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/30a136c871c453e55714fb6db87ad6175c151e90"/></media></figure></para>
<table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <thead/>
  <tbody>
    <row>
      <entry scope="row" class="emphasis">
        \(h\)
      </entry>
      <entry>
        0
      </entry>
      <entry>
